ded_packages</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></span>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>I then used</p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">        gl &lt;- <a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458250421000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ykxiVcjj7ShyvcLtrTcTL\">testset.gl</a></span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">        </span><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span>&gt; </span></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">gl.plot(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458250421000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ykxiVcjj7ShyvcLtrTcTL\">testset.gl</a>) ## to test the installation!</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></span>\r\n\r\n<p>With this result:</p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(197,6,11)\">Error in gl.plot(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458250421000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0ykxiVcjj7ShyvcLtrTcTL\">testset.gl</a>) : could not find function &quot;gl.plot&quot;</span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:rgb(197,6,11)\"> </span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">This one works</span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:blue\">levels(pop(gl)) ## for a list of unique population names</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></span><span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"> </span></span>\r\n\r\n<p>works as does</p>\r\n\r\n<span style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;word-break:break-all\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\">        nInd(gl </span><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;color:black\">and similar commands</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;;color:black\"></span></span>\r\n\r\n<p> </p>\r\n\r\n<p>BUT this one doesn’t work.</p>\r\n\r\n<span border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"1081\" style=\"width:810.4pt;background-image:initial;background-posi