    [
     1,
     "Okay, I solved this myself and I am putting my answer here because it may help others!<div>I got to the stage that indicated dartR was fully installed, but I tried gl.drop.pop and it would not work.</div><div>and then I noticed this output!</div><div><div><br></div><div><span aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;line-height:1.2;color:rgb(0,0,0);white-space:pre-wrap\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><span style=\"color:rgb(78,154,6)\">Be aware that owing to CRAN requirements and compatibility reasons not all functions of the package may run after the basic installation, as some packages could still be missing. Hence for a most enjoyable experience we recommend to run the function </span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(6,152,154)\">gl.install.vanilla.dartR()</span><span style=\"color:rgb(197,6,11)\">\r\n</span><span style=\"color:rgb(78,154,6)\">This installs all missing and required packages for your version of dartR. In case something fails during installation please refer to this tutorial: <a href=\"https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartR/wiki/Installation-tutorial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartR/wiki/Installation-tutorial&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458250424000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1d6uh_rfOz6Jx_KHeWpvah\">https://github.com/green-striped-gecko/dartR/wiki/Installation-tutorial</a>.</span></span></span><br>So I ran </div></div><div><span style=\"color:rgb(6,152,154);font-family:&quot;Lucida Console&quot;,monospace;font-size:13.3333px;white-space:pre-wrap\">gl.install.vanilla.dartR()</span><br></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">And lo and behold, I could do the things I wanted to do; </font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">such as drop pops and keep individuals.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div>gl.plot(<a href=\"http://testset.gl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://testset.gl&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792458250424000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3bADJSe4q34OKJQ9oJ0pKS\">testset.gl</a>) ## to test the installation! still would not work. <span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\"><br></font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">Hope this helps someone.</font></span></div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Sans Serif\" size=\"3\">Ruth</font></span></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
